string.text:
1) "Light indicator" displays amount of light on player. 

 2) "NPC vision" displays how the NPC (with the highest vision value on you) sees the player: 
 - White icon: NPC in normal state and does not see player; 
 - Yellow icon: NPC in combat/danger (has boosted vision parameters) and does not see player; 
 - Red icon: NPC sees player.
